### Payment service health
GET http://localhost:5103/health

### Pay for booking
POST http://localhost:5103/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID",
  "bookingId": "REPLACE_WITH_BOOKING_ID",
  "useDiscount": true
}

### Pay for booking without using an available discount
POST http://localhost:5103/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID",
  "bookingId": "REPLACE_WITH_BOOKING_ID",
  "useDiscount": false
}

### Get payment by ID
GET http://localhost:5103/payments/REPLACE_WITH_PAYMENT_ID

### Get user payment history
GET http://localhost:5103/payments/user/REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID

### Missing fields validation
POST http://localhost:5103/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID"
}
